label Greeting
[signal arg="refresh_desires"]
KuyaKap: Magandang gabi, apo. [pause=0.4]
if {Global_HighPriceActive}:
	KuyaKap: Hala, apo. Parang medyo masakit ata sa bulsa 'to ngayon ah? [pause=0.3] Tumataas na talaga presyo ng bilihin.
KuyaKap: Keeping up with the routine. Could you get me [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color]?
- Right away, Kuya.
[end_timeline]

label Talk
KuyaKap: Just my [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] when you're ready, apo. [pause=0.4] No rush.
- Alright, one moment.
	KuyaKap: Take your time.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, I can't get that right now.
	KuyaKap: Ah, is that so? [pause=0.4] That's alright, apo. [pause=0.3] Some things are worth waiting for, I suppose.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[end_timeline]

label Partial
KuyaKap: Salamat. [pause=0.4] Just waiting on the [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color] to complete the set. 
[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
if {Transaction_WantsDebt}:
	KuyaKap: Salamat talaga, apo. [pause=0.5]
	KuyaKap: [pause=0.4] ...Ah. [pause=0.4] My pockets feel a bit light today. [pause=0.3] I think I left my coins at home.
	KuyaKap: Would it be alright if I put this on [color=#0f6e2f]utang[/color] for now? [pause=0.4] I'll settle it with you tomorrow, promise.
	- Sure, Kuya. Take care.
		[signal arg="utang_accepted"]
		KuyaKap: Salamat. [pause=0.4] You're a kind soul, just like your Lola. 
		KuyaKap: See you tomorrow, apo.
	- Sorry, I can't do credit right now.
		[signal arg="utang_rejected"]
		KuyaKap: Hehe. I understand, apo. [pause=0.4] A business must stay a business after all.
		KuyaKap: I'll just come back when I have the change. [pause=0.4] Mag-iingat ka!
else:
	KuyaKap: Salamat, apo. [pause=0.4] You really have your Lola's touch with keeping this place alive.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label WrongItem
KuyaKap: Hmm. [pause=0.4] I don't think this is my [color=#0f6e2f]{Transaction_ItemWants}[/color], apo.
- Oh, sorry about that! Let me fix it.
	KuyaKap: Hehe. Don't worry. [pause=0.3] I'm not going anywhere.
	[end_timeline]
- Sorry, we're actually all out.
	KuyaKap: Ah, is that it? [pause=0.4] That's alright, apo. [pause=0.4] We'll just try again tomorrow.
	[signal arg="refuse_service"]
	[signal arg="story_success"]
	[end_timeline]